The film follows the abduction of two young girls in Pennsylvania and
the subsequent search for the perpetrator by the police.

15
01:49:17,142 --> 01:49:23,142
After police arrest a young suspect and release him, the father of
one of the daughters takes matters into his own hands.

16
01:56:34,285 --> 01:56:40,285
Prisoners premiered at the Telluride Film Festival on August 30, 2013,
and was released to theaters on September 20, 2013.

